    <string name="shizuku_intro_title">About Shizuku</string>
    <string name="shizuku_intro_body">Shizuku is an open-source project that exposes a system-level service through ADB so normal apps can use ADB-level APIs.\n\nFloatAI uses Shizuku to:\n• Read running process info.\n• Execute ATK terminal commands.\n• Invoke build toolchains.\n\nAfter authorizing, please verify that FloatAI appears in Shizuku\'s authorized apps list.</string>
    <string name="dhizuku_intro_title">About Dhizuku</string>
    <string name="dhizuku_intro_body">Dhizuku is an open-source project by the AndroidIDE team. It uses Device Owner to delegate elevated permissions to normal apps without root.\n\nFloatAI uses Dhizuku to:\n• Run process operations on non-root devices.\n• Run ATK terminal commands.\n\nAfter authorizing, please verify that FloatAI appears in Dhizuku\'s trusted apps list.</string>

